Ben & Jerry’s Coffee Coffee Buzz Buzz Buzz is a great flavour from Ben & Jerry’s. Good strong coffee ice cream with espresso chocolate fudge throughout, what’s not to like!

If like me you NEED coffee, you can steep (soak) your beans or pre ground coffee to extract the caffeine or you can use  instant coffee. The choice is yours depending on your taste, there is no RIGHT way to make coffee ice cream. 

So if you want to try this Coffee Coffee Buzz Buzz Buzz, here’s what you’ll need:

500g Milk
300g Cream
140g Sugar
50g Dextrose (if you don't have this, increase sugar to 180g)
60g SMP
2 Egg yolks
2g Stabiliser (optional)
50g of ground coffee beans/50g whole coffee beans/up to 40-50g instant coffee powder (which ever you prefer)

The fudge is simple to make and for that, you’ll need:

400g Condensed milk/sweetened condensed milk
200g dark chocolate
20g instant coffee/5g coffee extract

